{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c606379b1a11f7d45701a4d51fc26b409c7762f8e81fd9e7943803bd8d60bf2", "ja": "（真美の新しい衣装が届いた。水属性モンスターを\nイメージした、ファンタジーな衣装なのだが……）", "zh": "（真美的新服装送到了。这是一套以水属性怪物为灵感的奇幻服装，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "9b1252accc679121d8d6ee71aa900e032afd0c98feaf4af9778e27a297227230", "ja": "来たな、兄ちゃん！　おみずをくらえー！\nマミ、必殺のウォーターアターック！", "zh": "你来了，哥哥！接招吧，水花——！\n真美必杀的水之攻击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e9a7b55f3724d942e47e5220e1eb2b00de82368bb63f32dcbb515c788704f638", "ja": "うわっ！　び、びしょびしょになるー！？\n……ん？　何もない……？", "zh": "哇！要、要湿透了——！？\n……嗯？什么都没有……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "141087011c07203be0c4baef873746c97b84a4afda2d9f2f0275f5f0b33cf598", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　ひっかかったね、兄ちゃん！\n本当に水、かけられると思った？", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪上当了吧，哥！\n你真以为会被泼水吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bdd004e12c1b2575b0840cb48b4ab2e4d6f3862aa75c03583caab1ff102ca842", "ja": "ああ、ビックリしたよ。ドッキリだったとは……。\nしかし、なんでいきなり技名を？", "zh": "啊，吓了我一跳。没想到居然是恶作剧……\n不过，为什么突然喊起招式名称来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "54b3f64d214a31dcfb00e4e88289e9d9458a94c52445d3bdb8c930f2005eb31b", "ja": "そりゃもちろん、衣装のモチーフに合わせてだよ！\nピコモンといえば、やっぱり必殺技っしょ！", "zh": "那当然是为了配合服装的主题呀！说到ピコモン，果然还是必杀技嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "cb3da423966e959bf49dd8a63e017d48b0ca7def2088d2c3dcdd3802d0064ce0", "ja": "まあ、本当はちゃんと水を出したかったんだけど～。\nドッキリにしたのは仕方なく……お肉のサシだよ。", "zh": "哎，其实本来是很想好好喷出水来的啦～。\n搞成整人也是无可奈何……苦肉计的肉哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9b2d67437bd5cb151ed40193ca3e9de64e95916ebe208216fee64b9eba64a661", "ja": "苦肉の策、だな。\nというか、仕方なくっていうのはどういう……。", "zh": "还真是不得已才想出的办法啊。话说回来，你说的“没办法”到底是怎么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "8dc72a4539a6958cf92be516903e738e42ebacf4d4ccc2fa02579fa3ab2476c3", "ja": "実はねー……『劇場の中で、ホントに水を使っちゃ\nダメ！』って、律っちゃんに禁止令出されてさー。", "zh": "其实啊……律子姐下了禁令，\n说“绝对不能在剧场里面真的用水！”啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fa27e23a44d9402bf890b799ac366a07b44387df4f5c19d4fe083708b2b19533", "ja": "……なるほど。律子に先回りで対策されて、\nそれで技名を言うだけにしたってことか。", "zh": "……原来如此。因为被律子抢先一步采取了对策，\n所以才变成只喊招式名的吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "e844c9e3b6035859427a3467025a633a29cb40f55420aa7a4e79edd448a792c2", "ja": "そうそう。ホントは兄ちゃんの期待に応えて、\n水を使いたかったんだけど、怒られるからな～……。", "zh": "没错没错。本来想回应哥哥的期待，用水来着，可是会挨骂，所以啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba7a5aaac21a04f7c53e29a6ba5d8b48c0846962d351569ef7f75932856a2cc5", "ja": "……ってことで、兄ちゃん！\n今から一緒に、外に出かけよう！", "zh": "……所以说，哥哥！\n现在一起出门吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9018cb094008923dd43b8ca610d52b576cc7ea217b997ec0174921eb2ec8f1fc", "ja": "いや、別に期待はしてないけど。\nって外にって。一体何しに……あ、まさか。", "zh": "不，我倒也没抱什么期待就是了。\n不对，去外面？到底要去干什……啊，难不成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "36fc0f867773fe76c5b4f9021ffd9248e7e0030359d465244e36b187afd24efa", "ja": "そう！　律っちゃんに禁止されたのは、\nあくまで『劇場の中』でだけ……。", "zh": "对！律子姐禁止的，仅限于『剧场里面』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "55ff20cf430af493869e88aaf86b9f5e343d7a1411a7eeae7323c1a994ecdb4a", "ja": "つまり、『外』で水を使うぶんにはセーフなんだよ！\nいくらでも必殺技の練習し放題ってワケ！", "zh": "也就是说，只要在『外面』用水就没问题啦！想练多少次必杀技都行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1015_p", "source_sha256": "06ba964b1306667ae120fbebb20067e332e2cfe1ead7e16f62bd10d547c48199", "ja": "セーフ……か？　まあ、役作りの練習ってことなら、\n少しくらいは協力してもいいけど。", "zh": "安全……吗？不过，要是说成是为了塑造角色而练习的话，稍微配合一下也不是不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "1c00db2e4e7ac357f3ffa9850656e4cfdfce82c65a5eb2ba0586289f270b7890", "ja": "おお、さすが兄ちゃん、話が早いね！　それじゃあ、\n兄ちゃんにはとっておきの役で協力してもらおっかな！", "zh": "哦，不愧是哥哥，真爽快！那就让哥哥帮我演个特别的角色吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0581242d8fa9e73015e00dbb4a696149e23cc11017e516a0887cd456316fddd0", "ja": "とっておきの……役？\n嫌な予感しかしないのだが……。", "zh": "特别的……角色？\n我总觉得会有不好的预感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "826778a5918d61705be3d7abdd9a3601340cafb7f80aa52c5759ba9d2842987f", "ja": "大丈夫だよー！　真美と全力ピコモンバトルしてる\nモンスターの役だよ！", "zh": "没问题的啦～！就是跟真美全力进行皮克蒙对战的\n怪兽角色哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "e3b2e7a85d6c5bf321156b2e792654233a775bd725b7c3d431399ef85542843e", "ja": "いや～、まさか兄ちゃんが「真美の役作りのためなら、\n体を張ることは厭わない」と言ってくれるとは……。", "zh": "哎呀～，真没想到哥居然会说“为了帮真美揣摩角色，\n就算豁出命去也在所不惜”这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "fbbb40f5b52265334241147063a726a4b4beb82f6a0c727e3417b5afd3c20432", "ja": "んじゃ、早速行こっか！　真美がいっぱい水技を\n使うから、兄ちゃんは全部食らって感想よろしくね～♪", "zh": "那就赶紧走起吧！真美会使出好多水系绝招，\n老哥你可要全盘接下，然后说说感想哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_012mam0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_012mam0424_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c7cf5682e1ceff4b5304470615f6995b56e8bc37b39c11b71f6450942f993b5a", "ja": "ちょ、待った！　俺はそこまでの話は一言も……\nおーい待て！　真美ー！", "zh": "等等！我可一句都没说过要做到那种程度……\n喂——等一下！真美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
